{
  "slug": "persistent-planning",
  "name": "Persistent Planning",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Transforms Claude Code into a Manus-style persistent planner using on-disk markdown files as working memory. Creates structured task directories with task_plan.md and notes.md that persist across sessions. Enables multi-step project tracking, progress visibility, and knowledge storage that survives context resets. Based on proven context engineering principles for long-horizon AI tasks.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **7 commands**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `persistent-planning` (Transforms workflow to use persistent markdown files for planning, progress tracking, and knowledge storage)\n- **Commands** (7): `policy` (Get or set the persistent-planning update policy (auto | nudge | off)), `relink` (Re-run the skill linker — refresh symlinks from node_modules into .claude/skills/), `start-atom` (Add an atom (subagent hand-off unit) under an existing task in lg-mode persistent-planning), `start-planning` (Initialize persistent planning structure), `start-task` (Add a task under an existing phase in lg-mode persistent-planning), `status` (Show installed version, latest available version, current update policy, and hook registration state), `update` (Update persistent-planning to the latest version (runs npm update + re-links skills))\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `semantic-vault`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install persistent-planning@claude-community` from `TheGlitchKing/persistent-planning`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 7,
    "mcp": 1
  },
